  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n18 × [24 ÷ 70 × {25 × 49 ÷ (5 × 7)}]\n\nConcept used:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/c6dff4d58ce66b38e0cdda1b0a721fa32c2ef301f704e653b2f493673a6e332b.png] \n\n**Calculation:**\n\n18 × [24 ÷ 70 × {25 × 49 ÷ (5 × 7)}]\n\n⇒ 18 × [24 ÷ 70 × {25 × 49 ÷ 35}]\n\n⇒ 18 × [24 ÷ 70 × 35]\n\n⇒ 18 × 12\n\n⇒ 216\n\n**∴ The required answer is 216.**",
